  <!-- ==================== FAQS SECTION ==================== -->
  <section class="faq-section" style="padding: 85px 0; background-color: var(--bg-cream); border-top: 3px solid #000;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 860px;">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-subtitle">Common Questions</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Dumpster Rental Service FAQs</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-accordion">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            <span>Which dumpster rental service is right for my project?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>For household cleanouts or attic purges, a 15-yard or 20-yard residential dumpster is typically ideal. For construction debris, roofing, or major home remodels, our 20-yard or 30-yard heavy-duty roll-offs provide ample space. For commercial developments or large tear-downs, a 40-yard container delivers maximum capacity.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            <span>Do you offer same-day or next-day dumpster delivery?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes! We offer same-day and next-day delivery options across Wayne, Oakland, and Macomb counties. Order online or call our local dispatch office at (248) 479-3667 to reserve your container placement time.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            <span>How do you protect my driveway during drop-off and pickup?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>All Dumpsters 911 roll-off containers feature heavy-duty rubber wheels and protective placement boards. Our experienced drivers position your dumpster carefully on your driveway to prevent scratching, cracking, or surface damage.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            <span>What items are included in your flat-rate dumpster pricing?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Our flat-rate transparent pricing includes delivery, spot placement, your designated rental period, haul-away service, and generous weight allowances. There are no hidden fuel surcharges or surprise environmental fees.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

